=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2024-06-12<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F549997190165037963\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/549997190165037963</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E7%BB%AF%E7%BA%A2%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"绯红之夜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4d/n8nsc0ts53ynq2xdd5t2b5060o6694c.png/300px-%E7%BB%AF%E7%BA%A2%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"94\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4d/n8nsc0ts53ynq2xdd5t2b5060o6694c.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"308\" data-file-height=\"96\" /></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><big><big><font color=\"#f3c156\"><b>「绯红之夜」</b></font></big></big><b><br /></b>\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">.....................................................................................................</font><br /><br /></small>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bvideo\" data-id=\"BV1QS411P76H\" data-cid=\"0\" data-page=\"1\" data-title=\"「绯红之夜」前瞻PV\" data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"280\"></div><br />\n<small><font color=\"#bdb76b\">.....................................................................................................</font></small></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n光辉历九九二年春，这是伊利亚推翻旧邦国统治后，迎来独立的第七年。<br />在浪涌城，这座伊利亚最大的港口城市，商业贸易正迅速蓬勃地发展。然而，随财富远洋而来的还有盟国的勃勃野心。晶石走私屡禁不止，利益牵系错节盘根，平静的海面下，悄无声息地涌动着暗流。<br />让我们把时间回拨到本篇故事的七年前，一起回到索菲亚与拉维耶并肩走出军校校门的那个夏天，回看她们当初青涩和热血的模样，还有她们约定要共同守护的那座浪涌城……\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164212\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 118/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2544/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 259/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.915      1 -total\n 52.26%   21.381      1 模板:面包屑\n 42.01%   17.189      1 模板:文章戳\n  5.25%    2.150      1 模板:B站视频\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7467-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164212 and revision id 18033. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"PV","missing":true}],"images":["绯红之夜.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》「绯红之夜」前瞻PV","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"《铃兰之剑》「绯红之夜」前瞻PV","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》「绯红之夜」前瞻PV"}],"displaytitle":"《铃兰之剑》「绯红之夜」前瞻PV","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|PV}}\n=《铃兰之剑》「绯红之夜」前瞻PV=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=PV\n|时间=2024-06-12\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/549997190165037963\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<br>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n[[文件:绯红之夜.png|300px]]\n</div>\n<br>\n<center>\n<big><big><font color=#f3c156>'''「绯红之夜」</font></big></big><br>\n<small><font color=#bdb76b>.....................................................................................................</font><br><br></small>\n{{B站视频|BV1QS411P76H|1|「绯红之夜」前瞻PV|560|280}}<br>\n<small><font color=#bdb76b>.....................................................................................................</font></small></center>\n<br><br>\n光辉历九九二年春，这是伊利亚推翻旧邦国统治后，迎来独立的第七年。<br>在浪涌城，这座伊利亚最大的港口城市，商业贸易正迅速蓬勃地发展。然而，随财富远洋而来的还有盟国的勃勃野心。晶石走私屡禁不止，利益牵系错节盘根，平静的海面下，悄无声息地涌动着暗流。<br>让我们把时间回拨到本篇故事的七年前，一起回到索菲亚与拉维耶并肩走出军校校门的那个夏天，回看她们当初青涩和热血的模样，还有她们约定要共同守护的那座浪涌城……\n<br><br>\n[[file:官方消息175.png|560px|link=]]"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:13.458579+00:00"}